<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>两条路线的分野：引擎即用 vs 你拥有整个运行时</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 380, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>两条路线</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 16}}>引擎即用</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 10}}>你拥有整个运行时</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20}}>没有哪条更先进——只有你先付哪笔成本。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 748, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 18, alignItems: "center", paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", width: 120}}>定位</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>成品 agent 引擎，随产品交付</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>可组合的运行时，能力自己装</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 18, alignItems: "center", paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", width: 120}}>接入路径</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>短 —— 引擎即用</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>长 —— 要多写不少东西</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 18, alignItems: "center", paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", width: 120}}>修改权</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>由产品定义</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>每一层都能替换</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 18, alignItems: "center", paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", width: 120}}>治理默认</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>沙箱、审批已内建</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>要自己选并验证插件组合</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 18, alignItems: "center", paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", width: 120}}>你要承担</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>适配它的扩展边界</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45}}>治理、白名单、审计自建</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>31 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
